Package: dnscan
Version: 209.281721e
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, python, python-cryptography
Section: recon
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/rbsec/dnscan
Description: A python wordlist-based DNS subdomain scanner
 dnscan uses a wordlist to brute-force subdomains for a given domain.
 It supports TCP/UDP DNS, zone-transfer attempts, TLD expansion and
 virtual-host checking.
